      <p dir="auto">I agree with <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jackcaron/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jackcaron">@jackcaron</a> that we should pick a single channel, for two reasons:</p>
